== Bugs ==
{{Bug|Learning Drain Vitality before learning all three words of [[Skyrim:Marked for Death|Marked for Death]] may cause Marked for Death to become glitched so no newer words may be learned.|UDGP|1.1|dlc=DG}}
{{Bug|Learning a word of Marked for Death after having installed Dawnguard causes one or two glitched shouts to appear in the Shouts menu. It is named Drain Vitality, but has all three words of Marked for Death. The recharge is 12,12,12 and the bugged description says "Drains ''x'' points of Health per second for 20 seconds. Drains ''x'' points of Magicka per second for 20 seconds. Drains ''x'' points of stamina per second for 20 seconds." ''Using'' the shout causes the effect listed - although no words are actually shouted by the character.|UDGP|1.1.2|dlc=DG}}
**Learning the Drain Vitality shouts will then result in a second or third Drain Vitality shout, consisting of the right words of power, appearing in your Shout list. Also, if you obtained the location of this shout via the Greybeards, the quest will not update upon learning the Drain Vitality Shout and you will be unable to learn new shouts from the Greybeards.
**{{pc22}}To fix this bug open the [[Skyrim:Console|console]] and type in the following command: <code>player.removeshout 02018244</code> for the 1 point version or <code>player.removeshout 020181b8</code> for the 2 point version or <code>player.removeshout 020181b7</code> for the 3 point version. Also see [[Skyrim:Form ID|Form ID]] for more information on the xx.
**A way to fix either bug above is to perform the following steps:
::# Find a save in which you have not learned any words of Marked for Death and have not started the Dawnguard questline.
::# Delete/uninstall Dawnguard.
::# Load up the save and get all three words for Marked for Death.
::# Reinstall/re-download Dawnguard.
{{Bug|The Word Wall in the Forgotten Vale may not give you its word, even though it goes through the animations for it. The word also remains glowing on the rock, as if the word is still available.|confirmed=0}}

